  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven : 16 Y 4 Y 6 Y 12 Y 2\n\nAccording to the question, after replacing the numbers :\n\nOption 1) ÷, ×, =, × \n\n16 Y 4 Y 6 Y 12 Y 2 ⇒ 16 ÷ 4 × 6 = 12 × 2\n\n⇒ __**16 ÷ 4**__ × 6 = __**12 × 2**__\n\n⇒ __**4 × 6**__ = 24\n\n**⇒ 24 = 24 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nOption 2) ÷, -, =, -\n\n16 Y 4 Y 6 Y 12 Y 2 ⇒ 16 ÷ 4 - 6 = 12 - 2\n\n⇒ __**16 ÷ 4**__ - 6 = __**12 - 2**__\n\n⇒ __**4 - 6**__ = 10\n\n⇒ -2 ≠ 10 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3) ×, =, -, ÷ \n\n16 Y 4 Y 6 Y 12 Y 2 ⇒ 16 × 4 = 6 - 12 ÷ 2\n\n⇒ __**16 × 4**__ = 6 - __**12 ÷ 2**__\n\n⇒ 64 = 6 - 6\n\n⇒ 64 ≠ 0 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4) ÷, ×, =, -\n\n16 Y 4 Y 6 Y 12 Y 2 ⇒ 16 ÷ 4 × 6 = 12 - 2\n\n⇒ __**16 ÷ 4**__ × 6 = __**12 - 2**__\n\n⇒ __**4 × 6**__ = 10\n\n⇒ 24 ≠ 10 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 2\" is the correct answer.",
